---
/**
 * About Us page: “The Purpose Behind VentureBean” section.
 */
---

<div
  class="vb-element vb-element-6b774cb e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent"
  data-id="6b774cb"
  data-element_type="container"
  data-e-type="container"
  data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
>
  <div class="e-con-inner">
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-a1ac1a5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="a1ac1a5"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-c3cfd36 vb-widget vb-widget-heading"
        data-id="c3cfd36"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="heading.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <h2 class="vb-heading-title vb-size-default">The Purpose Behind VentureBean</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-c87f821 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="c87f821"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-3edff1c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
        data-id="3edff1c"
        data-element_type="container"
        data-e-type="container"
        data-settings={'{"background_background":"classic"}'}
      >
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-2e05541 vb-widget vb-widget-text-editor"
          data-id="2e05541"
          data-element_type="widget"
          data-e-type="widget"
          data-widget_type="text-editor.default"
        >
          <div class="vb-widget-container">
            <p>
              VentureBean was founded on the belief that sustainable business growth and people development must go hand
              in hand.
            </p>
            <p>
              Drawing on over 3 decades of experience in business leadership, consulting, process excellence, and
              executive coaching, our Founder-Director, Mathew Isac, recognised common challenges:
            </p>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Organisations often focus on growing the business or developing people, but rarely both with equal
                intent.
              </li>
              <li>
                Professionals and leaders are too busy ‘doing’ rather than ‘investing’ in their future – activity vs
                development.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p>
              VentureBean was created to bridge that gap integrating strategic consulting with execution rigour,
              coaching and leadership, organisation development.&nbsp;
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-a8bfdb5 e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child"
        data-id="a8bfdb5"
        data-element_type="container"
        data-e-type="container"
      >
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-598af13 vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
          data-id="598af13"
          data-element_type="widget"
          data-e-type="widget"
          data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
        >
          <div class="vb-widget-container">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
              <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
                <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-road"></i> </span>
              </div>
              <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
                <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Vision </span></h3>
                <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                  To help build and sustain growth to true potential in organisations and people, with global impact.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="vb-element vb-element-febab5d vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
          data-id="febab5d"
          data-element_type="widget"
          data-e-type="widget"
          data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
        >
          <div class="vb-widget-container">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
              <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
                <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-tasks"></i> </span>
              </div>
              <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
                <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Mission </span></h3>
                <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                  To make globally benchmarked value in consulting, coaching and organisation development, accessible
                  and affordable with optimal, measurable RoI.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="vb-element vb-element-1c22f06 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child"
      data-id="1c22f06"
      data-element_type="container"
      data-e-type="container"
    >
      <div
        class="vb-element vb-element-a6088b6 vb-view-default vb-position-block-start vb-mobile-position-block-start vb-widget vb-widget-icon-box"
        data-id="a6088b6"
        data-element_type="widget"
        data-e-type="widget"
        data-widget_type="icon-box.default"
      >
        <div class="vb-widget-container">
          <div class="vb-icon-box-wrapper">
            <div class="vb-icon-box-icon">
              <span class="vb-icon"> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fab fa-codepen"></i> </span>
            </div>
            <div class="vb-icon-box-content">
              <h3 class="vb-icon-box-title"><span> Why We Exist </span></h3>
              <p class="vb-icon-box-description">
                To create a benevolent cycle of growth. When leaders grow, teams thrive. When teams thrive, businesses
                succeed. When businesses succeed with purpose, they create impact far beyond themselves, provide more
                opportunities for further growth.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
